00 1145 "First, we factor the equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}^{2}\\cdot {5}^{2x+1}+11x\\cdot {5}^{2x+1}+28\\cdot {5}^{2x+1} & =0 \\\\ ({x}^{2}+11x+28){5}^{2x+1} & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe can now apply the zero product property, which states that $ab=0$ if and only if $a=0$ or $b=0.$ This gives us two equations,\n\n$$\n{x}^{2}+11x+28=0\\,\\text{and}\\,{5}^{2x+1}=0.\n$$\n\nWe now solve each of these equations separately.\n\n- The equation ${x}^{2}+11x+28=0$ can be factored as\n\n$$\n(x+7)(x+4)=0,\n$$\n\nwhich leads to the solutions $x=-7,-4.$\n\n- The equation ${5}^{2x+1}=0$ has no solutions because ${5}^{2x+1}$ is positive for every real number $x.$\n\nTherefore, in ascending order, the original equation has the solutions \n\n$$\nx=-7\\,\\text{and}\\,x=-4.\n$$" 13194139534409 true] [17592186286801 1000 #edb/ref 17592186286802 13194139534409 true] [17592186286801 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534409 true] [17592186286801 1041 "field-1" 13194139534409 true] [17592186286801 1104 #edb/ref 17592186286802 13194139534409 true] [17592186286801 1110 #uuid "96f41be4-3aaa-5694-9690-776a6816a401" 13194139534409 true] [17592186286802 1034 "-7" 13194139534409 true] [17592186286802 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534409 true] [17592186286802 1111 #uuid "3ac81e57-f612-5fe7-82f7-86ccd0544642" 13194139534409 true] [17592186286803 1000 #edb/ref 17592186286804 13194139534409 true] [17592186286803 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534409 true] [17592186286803 1041 "field-2" 13194139534409 true] [17592186286803 1104 #edb/ref 17592186286804 13194139534409 true] [17592186286803 1110 #uuid "c7cf90c0-a1f5-591d-95c7-95dbf4c7eb69" 13194139534409 true] [17592186286804 1034 "-4" 13194139534409 true] [17592186286804 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534409 true] [17592186286804 1111 #uuid "62262cdb-bdd9-51cb-85b6-74ac22f72586" 13194139534409 true] [17592186286805 1017 #edb/ref 17592186286806 13194139534409 true] [17592186286805 1017 #edb/ref 17592186286808 13194139534409 